# Claude task tracking
tasks/
# BC-QA-061: `.claude/reviews` contains a slash, so it is anchored to the repo
# ROOT and did NOT ignore subproject review dirs -- backend-api/.claude/reviews
# and boomcard-mobile/.claude/reviews got tracked with 80 review files that the
# Agent X completion gates never read. `**/` ignores every nesting level.
**/.claude/reviews
